Energy analytics, budget auditing platform to monitor
household electricity consumption
    -Processes continuous data streams from smart home appliances
    -Provides users with immediate vis into overall power metrics
     and utility ongoing costs

Platform operates as automated tracking and early-warning ecosys.
Evaluates acc energy usage and financial spend against predefined
    targeted quotas (limits)
And simultaneously tracks individual appliances with
    - high speed in mem consecutive breach counters
to catch imm power limit violations

When a home breaches 100% budget threshold, platform dyn enforces
a premium penalty tariff tier and accelerates billing rates

When these quota breaches/ recurring device anomalies are detected,
we orchestrate a notif pipeline that utilizes gen ai to synthasize
and dispatch peronalized, tailored email alerts, guides consumer



WEB APP (client side frontend - interacts with the core to deliver a responsive monitoring dashboard)
CORE (Spring boot monolith - orchestrate real time streaming data, evaluates live threshold metrics
        , enforces dyn billing rules, drives the llm prompt pipeline)
TELEMETRY SENSORS (Autonomous bg sim)
APACHE KAFKA (distributed message broker, bidirectional event arch)
APACHE IGNITE (in-mem data grid, manages active appliance counters, handles instant penalties, serves high-freq UI)
POSTGRESQL DATABASE (maintains structured data requiring strict ACID compliance, including master registries, historical logs, financial
audit trails, and permanent LLM recommendations)
GEMINI (LLM integrator for dyn prompts, transforms tech grid metrics to email alerts)
